        <li><a href="https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPV3VmeG1GclJtQzlLc0JfLXFUamNNU09Zd2tMeEZiUmJRR1hfVGNVZFpjYVJtaEpDamJXSmFmWFhrMnhOSFdyMk80cWF2QXpIVlQxQmhDbi1rRzIyeVNteE4zbkF2UVhTX3dSMms4eHZkWHVmeDQydk9USldQLWZ5dlp1a216dnU0dWExSWl2TVgzYlp1dnd0UWJ3?oc=5" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">高盛列出中国电池龙头股 — Yahoo Finance</a></li>
